# Implementation Plan - Modernize Custom Factors Page

Modernize the "Custom Factors" page to match the premium, glassmorphism design of the dashboard and profile pages. This includes updating the sidebar, top bar, and form styling.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This update will move inline styles from [custom-factors.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.html) to a new `custom-factors.css` file to improve maintainability and performance.

## Proposed Changes

### UI & Styling

#### [MODIFY] [custom-factors.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.html)
- Replace legacy sidebar with the modernized sidebar (with account dropdown) used in [dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.html).
- Update top bar with breadcrumbs and mobile toggle.
- Refactor form containers to use `.card` class and glassmorphism styling.
- Remove extensive inline `<style>` block.
- Add link to `custom-factors.css`.

#### [NEW] [custom-factors.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.css)
- Define specific styles for custom factors forms and lists.
- Ensure consistency with [dashboard-dark.css](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard-dark.css).

### Logic & Interaction

#### [MODIFY] [sidebar-profile.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/sidebar-profile.js)
- Add logic to handle the account dropdown toggle (currently duplicated in [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.js)).
- Ensure user info is populated in both sidebar and dropdown.

#### [MODIFY] [custom-factors.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.js)
- Update [loadFactors](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.js#3-37) and [loadFacilities](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.js#112-143) to render items using more premium card-based layouts.
- Integrate success/error toasts for all actions.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated/Browser Testing
- Use the browser tool to:
    1. Navigate to [/custom-factors.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/custom-factors.html).
    2. Verify the sidebar dropdown opens and shows correct user info.
    3. Test creating a new custom factor and facility.
    4. Test deleting a factor and facility.
    5. Verify responsive layout on mobile views.

### Manual Verification
- Verify the "glassmorphism" effect is consistent with other modernized pages.
- Check for any visual regressions in the input fields or buttons.
- Confirm sidebar active state is correctly set to "Custom Factors".
